# Template for LOCAL-ONLY Worker secrets. T0019 reads these only on the configured local origin.
#
# 1. Copy to `.dev.vars` (git-ignored) only when T0019 local login testing needs it.
# 2. Fill values locally. NEVER commit, paste into an issue/PR/chat, or log real values.
# 3. Staging/production values are set with `npx wrangler secret put NAME --env <env>`,
#    never in this file or in wrangler.jsonc. See docs/T0018_Owner_Setup.md.
#
# BETTER_AUTH_SECRET=        # 32+ random bytes, e.g. `openssl rand -base64 32`; unique per environment
# APP_ORIGIN=              # Exact http://127.0.0.1:8787 or http://localhost:8787
# DISCORD_CLIENT_ID=
# DISCORD_CLIENT_SECRET=
# GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
# GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=
